1525487" ext-link-type="pubmed">S99&#x02013;S384</related-article></bold></p><p>Itamar Raz, MD, should have been listed as the guest editor of the <italic>Proceedings of the 3rd World Congress on Controversies to Consensus in Diabetes, Obesity and Hypertension (CODHy)</italic>. The online version of the cover reflects these changes.</p></body></article>